notes.content:
This was the last update for corrections and improvements in version 1.3.20.x. The next update will be V1.4.20.0 and we will have news regarding the objective of the game.

// - Fixed water bottle not recovering thirst.
// - Fixed steps with grass sound in the houses.
// - Created an animal spawn on the farm.
// - Removed shovel from the game (now it is useless, since there are no more clay constructions).
// - Decreased font size of the spawnable item widget.
// - Fixed respawn errors.
// - Corrected when throwing a gun on the floor and picking it up, it loses its ammunition.
// - Texture changed above and below the tree log when cutting.
// - Fixed when equipping backpack the mouse disappears.
// - Fixed some bugs related to the offline game.
// - Fixed shots not hitting character properly on the dedicated server.
// - Fixed bugs of not being able to hit after changing melee weapon.
// - Now there is an effect on the camera when radiation is below 400.
// - Changed the branches of the smallest tree on the map to be filled with more leaves.
// - Height of some buildings increased (consequently the scale of some objects was adjusted).
// - Fixed language bug in the main menu.
// - Sun color changed again (we are testing a lot).

This update was focused on the look of the game, as I said some time ago. Here we complete this transition from a game with various visual styles, to a game with homogeneous textures. I also worked better on the map, which I said was still under construction.
As much as the focus was on the visual, also important changes in the gameplay.

Fixed:
// - Fixed double click on duplicate materials in the chest.
// - Fixed spawnable materials.
// - Fixed spawnables where they shouldn't be.

Changes:
// - Decreased speed needed to take fall damage.
// - It is now possible to rotate all collapsible objects.
// - Torch fire slightly altered.
// - Reduction of ammo loots around the map (changed to weapons).
// - You now have up to 10 rounds to get the ammo loot.
// - Reduced foliage in some areas.
// - Added foliage in the city.
// - Bank redone.
// - New buildings created.
// - Now the texture of the radioactive bear is more similar to that of the radioactive wolf.
// - Texture of the remainder of the remainders meshes.

- In this uptade I worked on corrections and changes that did not break the gameplay, but bothered me a lot. It is basically a polishing of what already exists.
- Some updates ago I thought I had fixed the error of spawnable loots not appearing during the game. Apparently this error still existed (I hope I have corrected it now). This error is caused by a configuration that does not make much sense within the engine, and it is very difficult to configure correctly.

Fixes:
// - Fixed dedicated server not saving ammunition from the weapon.
// - Fixed drop widget going off the screen.
// - Fixed writing "new map" in the name of the official map in the list of servers.
// - Fixed when picking up wood in the tutorial your stone disappears.
// - Fixed the thickness of the lines of some asphalt.
// - Fixed tutorial button when "enter to exit" appears for a long time does not work.
// - Fixed jumping by canceling hand animations.
// - Fixed the involuntary zoom when clicking with the right mouse button with the inventory open and an equipped weapon.
// - Fixed on a few occasions being possible to see through the wall.
// - Fixed flag widget bug.
// - Fixed bugs related to voice.
// - Fixed dedicated server not saving equipment.
// - Fixed inside houses and the laboratory not leaving sound of the steps.
// - Fixed when a character enters the water, the camera of others has the effect of water.
// - Fixed every player hears the sound of radiation when one enters the area.
// - Fixed not taking radiation damage.
// - Fixed cloth shirt with the character's texture.
// - Fixed not showing game skins.
// - Fixed not taking damage from drowning.
// - Fixed weapons without reload noise when placing in hand.
// - Fixed craftable sniper with wrong rotation in the hand.
// - Fixed bugs related to the swimming system.
// - Fixed spawnable loots no appearing.

Modifications:
// - Chicken scale increased by 1.5x
// - Now getting out of the pool is easier.
// - Improved interaction text.
// - When standing on the stairs now it automatically descends.
// - Relief of the modified landscape, to make it easier for the player to walk through it.
// - Jump height decreased.
// - Now there are more animals around the map.
// - Now when walking backwards your speed is divided by 2.
// - The default inventory size is now 9, and the cloth backpack adds 3 slots.
// - Now if you click on a craft and increase the amount of craft, then click on another, the amount is reset to 1.
// - Transition from grass to sand is now smoother.
// - Now there is a numbering in the sensitivity to have a better reference.

- With this update we officially left the Alpha version and entered the Beta version. I decided this because in addition to having fixed most bugs, we have implemented features that already characterize our game well.

- What I consider most important about this update is that we have a new map! Why did I decide to create another one? It turns out that this first map (Medium City) was too closed for our proposal. The objective of the game is to control regions by means of flags, something that becomes more fun on a larger and more open map.

- I would like to say that the new map is not finalized, as we were having problems with the team (which even caused the delay to update), so this new map and several upgrades in the version will be released soon. This goes against what I said earlier, that we wouldn't rush updates, but it bothers me to be without updates for so long, so I decided to release anyway.

- We are now making a style transition. As you can see, some textures in the game are completely different from others, so we are leaving everything standardized.

I hope you really like the changes, good game! 

Changes:
// - "Medium City" map deleted.
// - Removed motion blur (I didn't even know it was activated).
// - Small improvement in the materials of objects in the landscape.
// - Now it's easier to hit the attack on resources and animals by melee weapons.
// - Now it is also possible to take stone from the landscape (as wood is taken from trees).
// - Removed feather from the arrow recipe.
// - Dedicated server saving all progress every hour.
// - Now you can swim in the pool in every house.
// - Now you don't unequip the Canteen or the Water Bottle when you start swimming, which makes it easier to fill it.
// - Some changes and improvements in the lighting of the map.
// - Improvement in the animal spawn system.
// - When you stop following the character, now the animal returns to its starting position.
// - Now the main menu scene is nocturnal.
// - Now the interaction words are locked on the object, instead of being targeted.

News:
// - Now we have a tutorial for new players.
// - "Nuclear Disaster" map created.
// - Now we have a map that can be built with 5 clothes.
// - New foods added.
// - Constructions with 100% more life when all members of the group are offline.
// - Recently added writings translated into Portuguese.
// - Fixed game starting in Portuguese but in settings says it is in English.

As i said before, this version we focused in new features, besides we still fixing bugs. Note that we changed the version from V1.1.20.X to V1.2.20.0. This means that we are in a new patch, so we consider this version the most significant after the launch.

Remember that the format is: V{version}.{patch}.{year}.{debug}.

Fixed and changes:
//- Fixed some warnings flooding server's log.
//- Fixed no ammo saved when drop a charged weapon on chest and containers.
//- Fixed camera flicks on equip and unequip weapon.
//- Fixed animals in idle forever.
//- Reworked shooting system to actually work.
//- Removed drop bullet mechanic(we probably will implement this later).
//- Slight character movement changes.
//- Now when you drink dirty water you lose radiation instead health points.

Features:
//- Now when you press Q(default hotkey) you drop 1 unit of your selected item.
//- Now you can set your hotkeys.
//- Now on destroy a chest it items are dropped.
//- Radioactives animals added.
//- Sleeping bag added.
//- Bear Trap added.
//- New loot box added to distinguish guns to normal loots.
//- Some sounds added.
//- Craftable wood canteen added.

Changes:
//- Changed forest tree mesh
//- Reworked drop menu
//- Decrease Hawk speed
//- Updated Blazer Scope's marks.
//- In some areas the Medium City's foliage was redone.
//- Now radbox is despawning after 5 minutes
//- Now toasted foods gives more food points
//- Now when you load your character, if you had a group after logout, it is also loaded.

Fixes:
//- Fixed mouse sensivity not being updated when changed in game.
//- Fixed giving other rock instead torch when respawning.
//- Fixed getting radiation points instead lose when drinking from a well.
//- Fixed character reopening his eyes after changing his bag.
//- Fixed pickable items falling through landscape
//- Fixed crouch nor working properly
//- Fixed a lot of things in containers system
//- Fixed hard to fill water bottle in rivers
//- Fixed dedicated server not loading items properly
//- Fixed pants material
//- Fixed being hitted with meele weapons by a friend
//- Fixed invunerable character's material lasting forever.
//- Fixed cannot interact when placing things.

Earlier i played with some friends and we realized that there are still many bugs that i did not notice. This should be the last update of the fixes, but for now we are still going to fix bugs, and i don't intend to rush the game, so we will do things calmly but right.

Changes and fixes:
//- Fixed dedicated server not loading your items and position.
//- Fixed blank space on playerlist.
//- Fixed not getting initial items on server.
//- Fixed containers items not being saved in LAN.
//- Fixed anims in the Steam inventory.
//- Fixed "beber" translation in portuguese UI.
//- Fixed crouching anim freezing.
//- Fixed Rad Box still being visible after pickup.
//- Fixed hitting when you click into the inventory or craft menu.
//- Fixed workbench not being saved in LAN.
//- Fixed some resources last forever.
//- Fixed moon opaque in day.
//- Fixed going down through a house's floor. 
//- Fixed Night Vision Googles sound being triggered on equip a cloth hat with a other of it already equiped.
//- Fixed can see through map while swimming.
//- Fixed pickable doors always been the clay door.
//- Fixed wolf and bear not runnig.
//- Fixed doors spawning always as clay.
//- Now hatchet and pickaxe makes everything easier, but hatchet takes more wood and pickaxe takes more stone(as suggested).
//- Now when you do not get a wood from a tree you revieve the "miss" notification(as suggested).
//- Now just group members can open Bronze doors, Iron doors and windows.
//- Now you cannot create a group with a name that already exist.
//- Now when placing a item while you are placing other item, the first is stopped.
//- Now on drop or drag any item, if you are placing something the action is stopped.
//- Now when you eat raw meat you lose radiation points.
//- Now when you drink from a well you lose radiation points instead health.
//- Slight changes in cave to be easier to walk inside it.
//- Maximum number of animals per region increased.
